    "anchor_provisional": "COVERAGE-LIMITED - rests on 1 of 5 shipped scenarios, and the most static one. FIFTH value in a row to reject its predecessor; every one was internally clean. Mobility atoms may additionally read low (sprint overcorrection). Best-founded to date, not settled.",
